# H4xxHub — UI Library & Loader

> Dokumentasi untuk `H4xx_UI.lua` dan `Loader_Example.lua`

---

## 📦 Daftar File

| File | Fungsi |
|------|--------|
| `H4xx_UI.lua` | Library UI utama — window, tab, section, toggle, slider, key system |
| `Loader_Example.lua` | Template loader — contoh cara pakai `H4xx_UI` + key system |

---

## 🎨 H4xx_UI.lua

Library UI modern untuk Roblox script. Dibungkus dari VYX UI dengan API yang lebih simpel.

### Load Library

```lua
local VYX = loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/H4xxHub/H4xxHub/main/H4xx_UI.lua"))()
```

Membuat Window

```lua
local Window = VYX:CreateWindow({
    Title       = "H4xx",
    TitleAccent = "Hub",
    Subtitle    = "Premium • Modern • Simple",
    Logo        = "",
    LogoTint    = false,
    IconTint    = true,
    Folder      = "H4xxHub",
    ToggleKey   = Enum.KeyCode.RightShift,
})
```

Tab & Section

```lua
local Main = Window:AddTab("Main", "", "🏠")
local Farm = Main:AddSection("Auto Farm")
```

Toggle

```lua
Farm:AddToggle({
    Name     = "Auto Farm",
    Flag     = "AutoFarm",
    Default  = false,
    Callback = function(v)
        getgenv().AutoFarm = v
    end
})
```

Slider

```lua
Farm:AddSlider({
    Name      = "Speed",
    Flag      = "Speed",
    Min       = 16,
    Max       = 100,
    Default   = 16,
    Increment = 1,
    Callback  = function(v)
        local hum = game.Players.LocalPlayer.Character
            and game.Players.LocalPlayer.Character:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
        if hum then hum.WalkSpeed = v end
    end
})
```

Dropdown

```lua
Farm:AddDropdown({
    Name     = "Location",
    Flag     = "TpLoc",
    Options  = { "Spawn", "Shop", "Boss" },
    Default  = "Spawn",
    Callback = function(v)
        print("Dipilih:", v)
    end
})
```

Button

```lua
Farm:AddButton({
    Name       = "Buy All",
    ButtonText = "Buy",
    Callback   = function()
        -- logic buy all
    end
})
```

Keybind

```lua
Farm:AddKeybind({
    Name     = "Quick Buy",
    Flag     = "QuickBuy",
    Default  = Enum.KeyCode.B,
    Callback = function()
        VYX:Notify("Quick buy!")
    end
})
```

TextBox

```lua
Farm:AddTextBox({
    Name        = "Custom Text",
    Flag        = "CustomText",
    Placeholder = "ketik...",
    Callback    = function(text)
        print("Input:", text)
    end
})
```

Label

```lua
local lbl = Farm:AddLabel("Status: idle")
lbl:Set("Status: running")
```

Notify

```lua
VYX:Notify("Script loaded!")
```

KeySystem

```lua
local ok = VYX:KeySystem({
    Title       = "H4xx",
    TitleAccent = "Hub",
    Subtitle    = "Key System",
    Logo        = "",
    Keys        = {},
    GetKeyLink  = "https://...",
    SaveKey     = true,
    Folder      = "H4xxHub",
    Validate    = function(key)
        return true
    end
})

if not ok then return end
```

Settings & Autoload

```lua
Window:BuildSettings("")
VYX:LoadAutoload()
```

Unload UI

```lua
VYX:Unload()
```

---

🚀 Loader_Example.lua

Template loader siap pakai. Isinya:

· Load H4xx_UI.lua
· Cek status key ke Cloudflare Worker
· Tampilkan KeySystem kalau belum punya key
· Buka UI utama kalau key valid

Cara Pakai

1. Copy file Loader_Example.lua
2. Ganti SCRIPT_ID sesuai script:
   ```lua
   local SCRIPT_ID = "namascript"
   ```
3. Paste ke executor

Konfigurasi Loader

```lua
local WORKER_URL  = "https://h4xx-key.h4xxhub.workers.dev"
local SCRIPT_ID   = "namascript"
local NETLIFY_URL = "https://h4xx-key.netlify.app/?uid=" .. playerId
                  .. "&script=" .. SCRIPT_ID
```

Variable Fungsi
WORKER_URL Endpoint Cloudflare untuk validasi key
SCRIPT_ID ID unik script (alfanumerik, max 12 char)
NETLIFY_URL Halaman get key (harus teruskan script param)

Alur Key System di Loader

```
1. /check-status?userId=...&scriptId=...
        │
        ├── hasKey: true  → langsung buka UI
        │
        └── hasKey: false → tampilkan KeySystem
                │
                ▼
        User klik "Get Key" → buka Netlify
                │
                ▼
        Netlify panggil /get-key?userId=...&scriptId=...
                │
                ▼
        User copy key → paste di KeySystem
                │
                ▼
        Loader panggil /check-key?key=...&userId=...&scriptId=...
                │
                ▼
        valid: true → simpan key → buka UI
```

Helper httpGetJSON

Loader menyediakan helper untuk request + decode JSON:

```lua
local function httpGetJSON(url)
    local ok, res = pcall(function() return game:HttpGet(url) end)
    if not ok or not res or res == "" then return nil end
    local ok2, data = pcall(function() return HttpService:JSONDecode(res) end)
    if not ok2 then return nil end
    return data
end
```

Dipakai untuk:

· checkStatusFromCloudflare() → /check-status
· validateKey() → /check-key

---

🔧 Menambah Script Baru

1. Copy Loader_Example.lua → rename (misal RoChess.lua)
2. Ganti SCRIPT_ID:
   ```lua
   local SCRIPT_ID = "RC"
   ```
3. Sesuaikan Title, TitleAccent, Subtitle
4. Tambah tab/section/fitur sesuai kebutuhan
5. Push ke repo
6. Update Netlify agar support script=RC

---

⚠️ Aturan SCRIPT_ID

Aturan Contoh
Hanya alfanumerik RC, AIMBOT, FARM123
Maksimal 12 karakter ROCCHESS (8) ✅, ROCCHESS1234 (12) ✅
Case-insensitive rc = RC = Rc
Tanpa spasi/simbol my-script → MYSCRIPT

Worker akan sanitize otomatis:

```javascript
scriptId.replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9]/g, "").toUpperCase().substring(0, 12)
```

---

🧪 Testing

Manual Test Worker

```bash
# Generate key
curl "https://h4xx-key.h4xxhub.workers.dev/get-key?userId=123&scriptId=namascript"

# Cek status
curl "https://h4xx-key.h4xxhub.workers.dev/check-status?userId=123&scriptId=namascript"

# Validasi key
curl "https://h4xx-key.h4xxhub.workers.dev/check-key?key=H4XX-NAMACRIPT-XXXX-XXXX&userId=123&scriptId=namascript"
```

Test di Executor

1. Paste loader
2. Cek notifikasi "Memeriksa status akses..."
3. KeySystem muncul (jika belum punya key)
4. Masukkan key → UI terbuka

---

🐛 Troubleshooting

Masalah Solusi
Key selalu invalid Cek sanitasi scriptId di worker (/check-key harus sanitize dulu)
UI nggak muncul Cek WORKER_URL, pastikan worker online
KeySystem loop Cek response /check-key di browser — harus {valid:true}
Netlify nggak generate key Pastikan Netlify baca &script= dan teruskan ke /get-key
JSONDecode error Worker return bukan JSON — cek status code di browser

